; The Ash dragon's roost, east of the hold. It no longer mirrors the Wild one - The 2026-08-28 layout rebuild made it a
; crater reached down a long exposed causeway, against the Wild roost's ice shelf and splinter
; field, because two dragon fights that share a floor plan are one fight held twice. Inherits scenes/regions/roost.tscn
; (Phase 35F). 100 m of floor, wider than the Wild dragon's, because ai.ash_dragon holds 60 m of
; territory to its 45.
;
; Dead grey ground, faintly ember-lit — the same ash/ember language AshenAffliction and
; CorruptionAppearanceController use, so a corrupted place and a corrupted creature read alike
; (ART_STYLE §2.2: materials, not new meshes).
